WEBVTT

00:00:04.096 --> 00:00:05.820
Watch out!

00:00:05.994 --> 00:00:08.606
Whoa! Waargh!

00:00:08.780 --> 00:00:10.521
Uncool, very uncool!

00:00:10.695 --> 00:00:13.132
Ah! Try this! [laughs]

00:00:14.133 --> 00:00:16.135
Guys, guys, guys!

00:00:19.007 --> 00:00:20.313
Ha-ha-ha!

00:00:20.487 --> 00:00:22.010
Maybe something smaller!

00:00:22.184 --> 00:00:24.622
No, no! Oh, no, no.

00:00:24.796 --> 00:00:26.493
[bunnies laugh]

00:00:26.667 --> 00:00:29.148
Ha, ha-ha, ha-ha, ha!

00:00:29.322 --> 00:00:31.977
Cute bunnies off the face!
Excuse me! OK, pardon me!

00:00:35.154 --> 00:00:37.199
Aaaargh!

00:00:41.682 --> 00:00:43.249
[Bunnies] Fire! Fire!

00:00:43.423 --> 00:00:44.816
We've lost them.

00:00:44.990 --> 00:00:47.645
Ah!

00:00:49.342 --> 00:00:51.344
[Bunnies] Whoa!

00:00:54.565 --> 00:00:55.696
[Bunnies] Again, again!

00:00:55.870 --> 00:00:57.524
Hah!

00:00:57.698 --> 00:00:59.526
Crane, catch!

00:01:00.875 --> 00:01:02.224
Wheee!

00:01:02.399 --> 00:01:04.009
- Gotcha!
- Yay!

00:01:04.183 --> 00:01:06.881
Whoa! Ow!

00:01:11.582 --> 00:01:12.670
Ha-ha!

00:01:12.844 --> 00:01:14.672
Guys, guys, guys,
give me a shove!

00:01:15.499 --> 00:01:17.414
Mantis, now!

00:01:20.155 --> 00:01:22.070
[Tigress] Heh-yah!

00:01:25.247 --> 00:01:26.814
[howling]

00:01:27.728 --> 00:01:30.731
[cries out]

00:01:30.905 --> 00:01:32.603
Is that all you've got?
'Cause it feels like

00:01:32.777 --> 00:01:34.779
I'm fighting a big,
old, fluffy cloud!

00:01:34.953 --> 00:01:36.955
Well, this cloud is
about to bring the thunder!

00:01:37.129 --> 00:01:39.523
- [clanging]
- Ooh! Ow! Ow!

00:01:40.567 --> 00:01:42.613
- Your turn!
- Huh? Ah! Ooh!

00:01:42.787 --> 00:01:44.528
Ha-ha-ha!

00:01:44.702 --> 00:01:46.617
- Why are there...
so many signs?
- [clanging]

00:01:46.791 --> 00:01:47.748
[howls]

00:01:53.580 --> 00:01:56.409
Ow, ow, ow! Ow, ow, ow!

00:01:58.237 --> 00:02:00.239
[both cry out]

00:02:02.937 --> 00:02:05.244
Come here!
Alakasquasho!

00:02:06.593 --> 00:02:09.944
Yes! Taste the defeat!

00:02:10.118 --> 00:02:12.120
Let me tell you something.

00:02:12.294 --> 00:02:14.471
Next time you mess with
a panda, you better
bring a whole...

00:02:14.645 --> 00:02:16.386
[snarling]

00:02:24.785 --> 00:02:27.962
I guess nobody told you,
if you mess with the wolf,

00:02:28.136 --> 00:02:29.181
you get the fangs.

00:02:29.355 --> 00:02:31.401
- Ooh!
- I've hit you twice.

00:02:31.575 --> 00:02:33.751
What are you going to do now?

00:02:36.623 --> 00:02:38.451
We surrender!

00:02:38.625 --> 00:02:39.583
Ha!

00:02:42.194 --> 00:02:45.110
You can chain my body,
but you'll never chain my...

00:02:45.284 --> 00:02:46.633
...warrior spirit.

00:02:46.807 --> 00:02:47.591
Hey, don't forget
the little guy.

00:02:47.765 --> 00:02:48.983
Did you just call...?

00:02:49.157 --> 00:02:50.985
Po, what are you doing?

00:02:51.159 --> 00:02:53.771
Trust me. I got a pl...
Aargh! Ow!

00:02:53.945 --> 00:02:56.861
No way. Eight-point
acupressure cuffs?

00:02:57.035 --> 00:02:58.602
Just like the ones
that held Tai Lung.

00:02:58.776 --> 00:03:01.039
The more you move,
the tighter they get. [howls]

00:03:01.213 --> 00:03:03.171
These are the best cuffs!
[grunts]

00:03:05.696 --> 00:03:08.350
Greetings, panda.
At last we meet!

00:03:09.787 --> 00:03:11.571
No, no.
No, no, no.

00:03:14.879 --> 00:03:18.491
We meet at last!
Yes, that's it.

00:03:18.665 --> 00:03:20.319
Greetings, panda.

00:03:20.493 --> 00:03:22.974
We meet at... [gasps]

00:03:23.148 --> 00:03:26.847
- You are afraid for a reason.
- I am not afraid.

00:03:27.021 --> 00:03:29.807
He is coming to me in chains.

00:03:29.981 --> 00:03:32.418
- If anyone should
be afraid, it's...
- You.

00:03:35.682 --> 00:03:38.163
Don't even think about it.

00:03:51.306 --> 00:03:54.222
I hope this turns out
better than your plan
to cook rice in your stomach,

00:03:54.396 --> 00:03:56.703
by eating it raw
and then
drinking boiling water.

00:03:56.877 --> 00:03:58.879
This plan is
nothing like that plan.

00:03:59.053 --> 00:04:01.012
- How?
- This one's going to work.

00:04:12.197 --> 00:04:13.459
[chuckles]

00:04:13.633 --> 00:04:15.592
Keep moving.

00:04:21.380 --> 00:04:23.861
Ah, my old enemy.

00:04:28.605 --> 00:04:30.258
Stairs.

00:04:30.432 --> 00:04:32.434
[thudding steps]

00:04:34.262 --> 00:04:37.701
- [thudding]
- [grunting]

00:04:51.018 --> 00:04:52.977
[Po groans]

00:04:58.809 --> 00:05:02.116
Thanks for carrying me
those last few flights. OK.

00:05:02.290 --> 00:05:04.641
I threw up a little bit
on the third floor.

00:05:04.815 --> 00:05:06.294
Someone might
want to clean that up.

00:05:06.468 --> 00:05:08.993
Is there some sort of
evil janitor or something?

00:05:09.167 --> 00:05:10.777
Greetings, panda.

00:05:10.951 --> 00:05:13.258
- We meet at...
- Hey, how you doing?

00:05:14.955 --> 00:05:16.435
Hey.

00:05:16.609 --> 00:05:19.481
You've grown up
bigger than I thought.

00:05:19.656 --> 00:05:22.441
Hey. Enough with
the poking around.

00:05:22.615 --> 00:05:25.444
Strong, hmm? Healthy.

00:05:25.618 --> 00:05:28.186
Look, I don't know
who you are,
but please stand aside, sir.

00:05:28.360 --> 00:05:30.797
- [whispers] That's a lady.
- Oh! Sorry.

00:05:30.971 --> 00:05:33.757
The beard threw me.
It's kind of misleading.

00:05:33.931 --> 00:05:36.977
- False advertising.
- Enough of this nonsense!

00:05:37.151 --> 00:05:38.805
Bring the prisoners to me.

00:05:38.979 --> 00:05:40.633
Sorry, ma'am.
Get ready, guys.

00:05:40.807 --> 00:05:43.288
Keep your eyes peeled
for the... weapon!

00:05:44.202 --> 00:05:46.160
Yeargh! Hah! Yah!

00:05:47.858 --> 00:05:50.077
Sparrow kick! Wyy-yah!

00:05:50.251 --> 00:05:52.123
We did it!
I just kung fu-ed it!

00:05:52.297 --> 00:05:54.125
Did you guys see that?
I was all like...

00:05:54.299 --> 00:05:56.301
Waaargh...!

00:05:57.650 --> 00:05:58.695
Oh!

00:05:59.826 --> 00:06:03.047
[Shen laughs]

00:06:03.221 --> 00:06:06.572
Do you actually believe
this is the warrior
destined to defeat me?

00:06:06.746 --> 00:06:09.793
I do not.
I know he is.

00:06:09.967 --> 00:06:12.230
[laughs] Oh, look at him.

00:06:12.404 --> 00:06:16.234
A lifetime to plot his revenge
and he comes to me
on his knees.

00:06:16.408 --> 00:06:18.366
What? A lifetime?
Whoa, whoa, whoa.

00:06:18.540 --> 00:06:20.151
I did not have a lifetime.

00:06:20.325 --> 00:06:21.979
We only heard about
Master Rhino a few days ago,

00:06:22.153 --> 00:06:23.415
and we came
to avenge him!

00:06:23.589 --> 00:06:26.810
You've come to avenge
nothing else?

00:06:26.984 --> 00:06:29.421
Well, yeah. All the pots
and pans that you stole.

00:06:29.595 --> 00:06:32.076
- I'm gonna want those back.
- Nothing else?

00:06:32.250 --> 00:06:34.948
You probably did some other
evil stuff along the way,
I don't know.

00:06:35.122 --> 00:06:36.950
- What else did you do?
- You don't know?

00:06:37.124 --> 00:06:38.343
- Know what?
- [laughter]

00:06:38.517 --> 00:06:40.084
What's so funny?

00:06:40.258 --> 00:06:42.826
The very thing that
you clearly do not know!

00:06:43.000 --> 00:06:46.917
OK, enough of these riddles!
Would you guys
spill the beans?

00:06:47.091 --> 00:06:50.398
First we come in
and the weapon is tiny.
Surprise, it's big.

00:06:50.572 --> 00:06:52.879
Then the lady over here,
I think it's a guy.

00:06:53.053 --> 00:06:54.707
'Cause he's got... Whoa!

00:06:54.881 --> 00:06:57.623
The only reason
you are still alive

00:06:57.797 --> 00:07:02.454
is that I find your stupidity
mildly amusing.

00:07:02.628 --> 00:07:05.892
Well, thank you.
But I find your evilness
extremely annoying.

00:07:06.066 --> 00:07:07.894
Who do you think you are,
panda?

00:07:08.068 --> 00:07:10.680
Who do you think I am,
peacock?

00:07:10.854 --> 00:07:12.986
[both laugh]

00:07:19.732 --> 00:07:22.387
Why are we laughing?
[sighs]

00:07:22.561 --> 00:07:23.693
Take aim.

00:07:35.269 --> 00:07:37.707
Fire. [laughs]

00:07:39.926 --> 00:07:40.840
Huh?

00:07:41.014 --> 00:07:43.756
Well, light the thing!

00:07:43.930 --> 00:07:45.889
I did!

00:07:50.284 --> 00:07:52.243
Fear the bug!

00:07:55.420 --> 00:07:56.421
Ha-ha!

00:08:01.121 --> 00:08:02.601
[Po] Get the weapon!

00:08:04.646 --> 00:08:06.648
Tigress!

00:08:14.787 --> 00:08:16.310
[screams]

00:08:19.749 --> 00:08:21.881
[continues screaming]

00:08:23.665 --> 00:08:25.015
[cheering]

00:08:30.194 --> 00:08:32.152
[crying]

00:08:39.333 --> 00:08:40.813
You... you were there.

00:08:40.987 --> 00:08:43.816
Yes. Yes, I was.

